+			// the water CB) rather than at the main-thread fill, for the s1-adapted-scene-scale 8.3
+			// tearing reason. .w is an anisotropy term and is not a radiance. Exactly 1.0 off the switch.
 			case ECGP_PB_VolumetricFogScatteringColor:
